@startuml "Webhook Stripe"

title Traitement webhook Stripe

participant "Stripe API" as Stripe
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Payment Service" as PaymentSvc
participant "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

Stripe -> API: POST /api/webhook/stripe
note right: Event: payment_intent.succeeded
API -> PaymentSvc: handleStripeWebhook(event)
PaymentSvc -> DB: SELECT payment WHERE stripePaymentId=?
DB --> PaymentSvc: payment data
PaymentSvc -> DB: UPDATE payment SET status='paid', paidAt=NOW()
PaymentSvc -> OrderSvc: updateOrderStatus(orderId, 'paid')
OrderSvc -> DB: UPDATE order SET status='paid'
OrderSvc -> TicketSvc: activateTickets(orderId)
TicketSvc -> DB: UPDATE tickets SET status='paid' WHERE orderId=?
PaymentSvc --> API: webhook processed
API --> Stripe: 200 OK

@enduml